      "text": "[{\"id\":0,\"author\":\"user\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Create an AI Headshot Photographer app. Users upload a casual selfie. They then select a desired style (e.g., \\\"Corporate Grey Backdrop,\\\" \\\"Modern Tech Office,\\\" \\\"Outdoor Natural Light\\\") and the app generates generic professional headshots based on that style.\",\"files\":[\"{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Nano banana powered app\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"text/plain\\\",\\\"size\\\":347,\\\"lastModified\\\":1770117855133,\\\"data\\\":\\\"\u003d\\\"}\"],\"fileUploads\":[],\"cMarkNode\":{}},\"createdTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770117855,\"nanos\":468000000}},{\"id\":1,\"author\":\"model\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"text\":\"**Developing the React Application**\\n\\nI\u0027m now focusing on the React application framework for an \\\"AI Headshot Photographer.\\\" The core functionality involves an upload for selfies and selection of styles. Next steps encompass styling options, and integrating the Gemini API to generate headshots, and I will be working on a user interface soon.\\n\\n\\n**Defining the API Calls**\\n\\nI\u0027m currently working on the API calls. I\u0027ve chosen `gemini-2.5-flash-image` for image generation and editing and am defining the logic for calling this API. The `gemini.ts` file will house the `generateHeadshot` function, which will receive a base64 selfie and a style string, preparing a prompt such as \\\"Transform this casual selfie.\\\" I am also focusing on the `metadata.json` for camera permissions.\\n\\n\\n\",\"cMarkNode\":{}},\"createdTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770117855,\"nanos\":468000000},\"doneTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770117862,\"nanos\":335000000}},{\"id\":2,\"author\":\"model\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"generationTable\",\"entries\":[{\"path\":\"metadata.json\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"App metadata with camera permissions for taking selfies.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\n{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"ProShot AI\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"Professional AI Headshot Photographer. Transform your casual selfies into stunning corporate headshots with various styles and AI-powered editing.\\\",\\n  \\\"requestFramePermissions\\\": [\\n    \\\"camera\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"index.html\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Main HTML entry point with Tailwind CSS support.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\n\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\\n\u003chtml lang\u003d\\\"en\\\"\u003e\\n  \u003chead\u003e\\n    \u003cmeta charset\u003d\\\"UTF-8\\\" /\u003e\\n    \u003cmeta name\u003d\\\"viewport\\\" content\u003d\\\"width\u003ddevice-width, initial-scale\u003d1.0\\\" /\u003e\\n    \u003ctitle\u003eProShot AI - Professional Headshots\u003c/title\u003e\\n    \u003cscript src\u003d\\\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\\\"\u003e\u003c/script\u003e\\n    \u003clink href\u003d\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family\u003dInter:wght@300;400;500;600;700\u0026display\u003dswap\\\" rel\u003d\\\"stylesheet\\\"\u003e\\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\\n      body {\\n        font-family: \u0027Inter\u0027, sans-serif;\\n      }\\n      .glass {\\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\\n        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\\n        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\\n      }\\n    \u003c/style\u003e\\n  \u003c/head\u003e\\n  \u003cbody class\u003d\\\"bg-gray-50 text-gray-900\\\"\u003e\\n    \u003cdiv id\u003d\\\"root\\\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\\n  \u003c/body\u003e\\n\u003c/html\u003e\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"index.tsx\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"React entry point using React 18 createRoot.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport React from \u0027react\u0027;\\nimport ReactDOM from \u0027react-dom/client\u0027;\\nimport App from \u0027./App\u0027;\\n\\nconst rootElement \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027root\u0027);\\nif (!rootElement) {\\n  throw new Error(\\\"Could not find root element to mount to\\\");\\n}\\n\\nconst root \u003d ReactDOM.createRoot(rootElement);\\nroot.render(\\n  \u003cReact.StrictMode\u003e\\n    \u003cApp /\u003e\\n  \u003c/React.StrictMode\u003e\\n);\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"types.ts\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Global types for the application.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nexport interface HeadshotStyle {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  prompt: string;\\n  image: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ProcessingState {\\n  status: \u0027idle\u0027 | \u0027loading\u0027 | \u0027success\u0027 | \u0027error\u0027;\\n  message?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ImageRecord {\\n  id: string;\\n  url: string;\\n  type: \u0027original\u0027 | \u0027generated\u0027 | \u0027edited\u0027;\\n  timestamp: number;\\n}\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"constants.tsx\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Application constants including predefined headshot styles.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport { HeadshotStyle } from \u0027./types\u0027;\\n\\nexport const HEADSHOT_STYLES: HeadshotStyle[] \u003d [\\n  {\\n    id: \u0027corporate-grey\u0027,\\n    name: \u0027Corporate Studio\u0027,\\n    description: \u0027Clean, professional grey backdrop with studio lighting.\u0027,\\n    prompt: \u0027Professional corporate headshot with a solid neutral grey studio backdrop. High-end studio lighting, sharp focus on the person, professional business attire.\u0027,\\n    image: \u0027https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560250097-0b93528c311a?auto\u003dformat\u0026fit\u003dcrop\u0026q\u003d80\u0026w\u003d300\u0026h\u003d300\u0027\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \u0027modern-tech\u0027,\\n    name: \u0027Tech Office\u0027,\\n    description: \u0027Modern, blurred office background with natural lighting.\u0027,\\n    prompt: \u0027Modern professional headshot in a bright, tech-oriented office environment with soft background bokeh. Casual professional attire, warm natural light.\u0027,\\n    image: \u0027https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?auto\u003dformat\u0026fit\u003dcrop\u0026q\u003d80\u0026w\u003d300\u0026h\u003d300\u0027\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \u0027outdoor-natural\u0027,\\n    name: \u0027Outdoor Professional\u0027,\\n    description: \u0027Nature-inspired soft daylight with a park or garden background.\u0027,\\n    prompt: \u0027Professional outdoor headshot with soft natural daylight. Blurred greenery and architecture in the background. Approachable and friendly professional look.\u0027,\\n    image: \u0027https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519085360753-af0119f7cbe7?auto\u003dformat\u0026fit\u003dcrop\u0026q\u003d80\u0026w\u003d300\u0026h\u003d300\u0027\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \u0027luxury-executive\u0027,\\n    name: \u0027Executive Suite\u0027,\\n    description: \u0027Premium wood-paneled office with classic executive feel.\u0027,\\n    prompt: \u0027Luxury executive headshot in a high-end wood-paneled office or boardroom. Rich lighting tones, formal business attire, prestigious atmosphere.\u0027,\\n    image: \u0027https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?auto\u003dformat\u0026fit\u003dcrop\u0026q\u003d80\u0026w\u003d300\u0026h\u003d300\u0027\\n  }\\n];\\n\\nexport const MODELS \u003d {\\n  IMAGE_GEN: \u0027gemini-2.5-flash-image\u0027\\n};\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"services/gemini.ts\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Service layer for interacting with Gemini 2.5 Flash Image API.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport { GoogleGenAI } from \\\"@google/genai\\\";\\nimport { MODELS } from \\\"../constants\\\";\\n\\n// Function to get the latest AI instance (mandatory for Veo-like flow, though we use standard process.env.API_KEY)\\nconst getAI \u003d () \u003d\u003e new GoogleGenAI({ apiKey: process.env.API_KEY || \u0027\u0027 });\\n\\n/**\\n * Converts a File object or URL to a base64 string\\n */\\nexport const fileToBase64 \u003d (file: File): Promise\u003cstring\u003e \u003d\u003e {\\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) \u003d\u003e {\\n    const reader \u003d new FileReader();\\n    reader.readAsDataURL(file);\\n    reader.onload \u003d () \u003d\u003e {\\n      const result \u003d reader.result as string;\\n      // Remove the \\\"data:image/png;base64,\\\" prefix\\n      resolve(result.split(\u0027,\u0027)[1]);\\n    };\\n    reader.onerror \u003d (error) \u003d\u003e reject(error);\\n  });\\n};\\n\\n/**\\n * Generates a professional headshot based on a selfie and a style prompt\\n */\\nexport const generateHeadshot \u003d async (base64Image: string, stylePrompt: string): Promise\u003cstring\u003e \u003d\u003e {\\n  const ai \u003d getAI();\\n  const prompt \u003d `\\n    Transform the person in this photo into a professional high-quality headshot. \\n    Instruction: ${stylePrompt}.\\n    Important: Keep the person\u0027s facial features, hair, and identity consistent with the source image. \\n    Ensure the output is a single, clear, front-facing portrait suitable for LinkedIn or a corporate website.\\n  `;\\n\\n  const response \u003d await ai.models.generateContent({\\n    model: MODELS.IMAGE_GEN,\\n    contents: {\\n      parts: [\\n        {\\n          inlineData: {\\n            data: base64Image,\\n            mimeType: \u0027image/png\u0027,\\n          },\\n        },\\n        { text: prompt },\\n      ],\\n    },\\n  });\\n\\n  for (const part of response.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts || []) {\\n    if (part.inlineData) {\\n      return `data:image/png;base64,${part.inlineData.data}`;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  throw new Error(\\\"No image data returned from Gemini\\\");\\n};\\n\\n/**\\n * Edits an existing image based on a natural language text prompt\\n */\\nexport const editHeadshot \u003d async (base64Image: string, editPrompt: string): Promise\u003cstring\u003e \u003d\u003e {\\n  const ai \u003d getAI();\\n  const prompt \u003d `\\n    Apply the following edit to this headshot: \\\"${editPrompt}\\\".\\n    Preserve the subject\u0027s identity and the professional quality of the photo.\\n  `;\\n\\n  const response \u003d await ai.models.generateContent({\\n    model: MODELS.IMAGE_GEN,\\n    contents: {\\n      parts: [\\n        {\\n          inlineData: {\\n            data: base64Image.includes(\u0027,\u0027) ? base64Image.split(\u0027,\u0027)[1] : base64Image,\\n            mimeType: \u0027image/png\u0027,\\n          },\\n        },\\n        { text: prompt },\\n      ],\\n    },\\n  });\\n\\n  for (const part of response.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts || []) {\\n    if (part.inlineData) {\\n      return `data:image/png;base64,${part.inlineData.data}`;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  throw new Error(\\\"No image data returned from Gemini\\\");\\n};\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"components/Layout.tsx\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Main layout wrapper component.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport React from \u0027react\u0027;\\n\\ninterface LayoutProps {\\n  children: React.ReactNode;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Layout: React.FC\u003cLayoutProps\u003e \u003d ({ children }) \u003d\u003e {\\n  return (\\n    \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"min-h-screen flex flex-col\\\"\u003e\\n      \u003cheader className\u003d\\\"sticky top-0 z-50 glass border-b px-4 py-4 sm:px-8\\\"\u003e\\n        \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between\\\"\u003e\\n          \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"flex items-center space-x-2\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200\\\"\u003e\\n              P\\n            \u003c/div\u003e\\n            \u003ch1 className\u003d\\\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900\\\"\u003eProShot AI\u003c/h1\u003e\\n          \u003c/div\u003e\\n          \u003cnav className\u003d\\\"hidden sm:flex space-x-6 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ca href\u003d\\\"#\\\" className\u003d\\\"hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\\\"\u003eHow it works\u003c/a\u003e\\n            \u003ca href\u003d\\\"#\\\" className\u003d\\\"hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\\\"\u003eStyles\u003c/a\u003e\\n            \u003ca href\u003d\\\"#\\\" className\u003d\\\"hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\\\"\u003ePricing\u003c/a\u003e\\n          \u003c/nav\u003e\\n          \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"flex items-center space-x-3\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cspan className\u003d\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50 px-2 py-1 rounded\\\"\u003eBeta\u003c/span\u003e\\n          \u003c/div\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n      \u003c/header\u003e\\n\\n      \u003cmain className\u003d\\\"flex-grow max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full px-4 py-8 sm:px-8\\\"\u003e\\n        {children}\\n      \u003c/main\u003e\\n\\n      \u003cfooter className\u003d\\\"bg-white border-t py-8 px-4 sm:px-8\\\"\u003e\\n        \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-gray-400 text-sm\\\"\u003e\\n          \u003cp\u003e© 2024 ProShot AI Photographer. Powered by Gemini.\u003c/p\u003e\\n          \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"flex space-x-4 mt-4 sm:mt-0\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ca href\u003d\\\"#\\\" className\u003d\\\"hover:text-gray-600\\\"\u003ePrivacy\u003c/a\u003e\\n            \u003ca href\u003d\\\"#\\\" className\u003d\\\"hover:text-gray-600\\\"\u003eTerms\u003c/a\u003e\\n            \u003ca href\u003d\\\"#\\\" className\u003d\\\"hover:text-gray-600\\\"\u003eSupport\u003c/a\u003e\\n          \u003c/div\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n      \u003c/footer\u003e\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n  );\\n};\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"components/StyleCard.tsx\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Selectable card for headshot styles.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport React from \u0027react\u0027;\\nimport { HeadshotStyle } from \u0027../types\u0027;\\n\\ninterface StyleCardProps {\\n  style: HeadshotStyle;\\n  isSelected: boolean;\\n  onSelect: (style: HeadshotStyle) \u003d\u003e void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const StyleCard: React.FC\u003cStyleCardProps\u003e \u003d ({ style, isSelected, onSelect }) \u003d\u003e {\\n  return (\\n    \u003cbutton\\n      onClick\u003d{() \u003d\u003e onSelect(style)}\\n      className\u003d{`relative group flex flex-col items-start p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 transition-all duration-300 text-left overflow-hidden ${\\n        isSelected \\n          ? \u0027border-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50/50 shadow-md ring-1 ring-indigo-600/20\u0027 \\n          : \u0027border-gray-100 hover:border-gray-200 bg-white\u0027\\n      }`}\\n    \u003e\\n      \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"aspect-square w-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-3\\\"\u003e\\n        \u003cimg \\n          src\u003d{style.image} \\n          alt\u003d{style.name} \\n          className\u003d\\\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\\\"\\n        /\u003e\\n      \u003c/div\u003e\\n      \u003ch3 className\u003d{`font-semibold text-sm ${isSelected ? \u0027text-indigo-900\u0027 : \u0027text-gray-900\u0027}`}\u003e\\n        {style.name}\\n      \u003c/h3\u003e\\n      \u003cp className\u003d\\\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-1\\\"\u003e\\n        {style.description}\\n      \u003c/p\u003e\\n      \\n      {isSelected \u0026\u0026 (\\n        \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"absolute top-4 right-4 bg-indigo-600 text-white p-1 rounded-full shadow-lg\\\"\u003e\\n          \u003csvg xmlns\u003d\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" className\u003d\\\"h-3 w-3\\\" viewBox\u003d\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill\u003d\\\"currentColor\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cpath fillRule\u003d\\\"evenodd\\\" d\u003d\\\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\\\" clipRule\u003d\\\"evenodd\\\" /\u003e\\n          \u003c/svg\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n      )}\\n    \u003c/button\u003e\\n  );\\n};\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"App.tsx\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Main application logic and UI flow.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport React, { useState, useRef, useCallback } from \u0027react\u0027;\\nimport { Layout } from \u0027./components/Layout\u0027;\\nimport { StyleCard } from \u0027./components/StyleCard\u0027;\\nimport { HEADSHOT_STYLES } from \u0027./constants\u0027;\\nimport { HeadshotStyle, ProcessingState, ImageRecord } from \u0027./types\u0027;\\nimport { fileToBase64, generateHeadshot, editHeadshot } from \u0027./services/gemini\u0027;\\n\\nconst App: React.FC \u003d () \u003d\u003e {\\n  const [selectedStyle, setSelectedStyle] \u003d useState\u003cHeadshotStyle\u003e(HEADSHOT_STYLES[0]);\\n  const [originalImage, setOriginalImage] \u003d useState\u003cstring | null\u003e(null);\\n  const [currentImage, setCurrentImage] \u003d useState\u003cImageRecord | null\u003e(null);\\n  const [processing, setProcessing] \u003d useState\u003cProcessingState\u003e({ status: \u0027idle\u0027 });\\n  const [editPrompt, setEditPrompt] \u003d useState(\u0027\u0027);\\n  const [history, setHistory] \u003d useState\u003cImageRecord[]\u003e([]);\\n\\n  const fileInputRef \u003d useRef\u003cHTMLInputElement\u003e(null);\\n\\n  const handleFileChange \u003d async (e: React.ChangeEvent\u003cHTMLInputElement\u003e) \u003d\u003e {\\n    const file \u003d e.target.files?.[0];\\n    if (file) {\\n      try {\\n        setProcessing({ status: \u0027loading\u0027, message: \u0027Analyzing your selfie...\u0027 });\\n        const base64 \u003d await fileToBase64(file);\\n        const dataUrl \u003d `data:image/png;base64,${base64}`;\\n        setOriginalImage(dataUrl);\\n        const newRecord: ImageRecord \u003d {\\n          id: Date.now().toString(),\\n          url: dataUrl,\\n          type: \u0027original\u0027,\\n          timestamp: Date.now()\\n        };\\n        setCurrentImage(newRecord);\\n        setHistory([newRecord]);\\n        setProcessing({ status: \u0027idle\u0027 });\\n      } catch (err) {\\n        setProcessing({ status: \u0027error\u0027, message: \u0027Failed to read file. Try another photo.\u0027 });\\n      }\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleGenerate \u003d async () \u003d\u003e {\\n    if (!originalImage) return;\\n\\n    setProcessing({ status: \u0027loading\u0027, message: `Crafting your ${selectedStyle.name} headshot...` });\\n    try {\\n      const base64 \u003d originalImage.split(\u0027,\u0027)[1];\\n      const resultUrl \u003d await generateHeadshot(base64, selectedStyle.prompt);\\n      const newRecord: ImageRecord \u003d {\\n        id: Date.now().toString(),\\n        url: resultUrl,\\n        type: \u0027generated\u0027,\\n        timestamp: Date.now()\\n      };\\n      setCurrentImage(newRecord);\\n      setHistory(prev \u003d\u003e [newRecord, ...prev]);\\n      setProcessing({ status: \u0027success\u0027 });\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      console.error(err);\\n      setProcessing({ status: \u0027error\u0027, message: \u0027AI generation failed. Please try again.\u0027 });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleEdit \u003d async () \u003d\u003e {\\n    if (!currentImage || !editPrompt.trim()) return;\\n\\n    setProcessing({ status: \u0027loading\u0027, message: \u0027Applying AI edits...\u0027 });\\n    try {\\n      const resultUrl \u003d await editHeadshot(currentImage.url, editPrompt);\\n      const newRecord: ImageRecord \u003d {\\n        id: Date.now().toString(),\\n        url: resultUrl,\\n        type: \u0027edited\u0027,\\n        timestamp: Date.now()\\n      };\\n      setCurrentImage(newRecord);\\n      setHistory(prev \u003d\u003e [newRecord, ...prev]);\\n      setEditPrompt(\u0027\u0027);\\n      setProcessing({ status: \u0027success\u0027 });\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      console.error(err);\\n      setProcessing({ status: \u0027error\u0027, message: \u0027Editing failed. The instructions might be unclear.\u0027 });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const reset \u003d () \u003d\u003e {\\n    setOriginalImage(null);\\n    setCurrentImage(null);\\n    setHistory([]);\\n    setProcessing({ status: \u0027idle\u0027 });\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    \u003cLayout\u003e\\n      \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8\\\"\u003e\\n        \\n        {/* Left Column: Controls */}\\n        \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"lg:col-span-4 space-y-6\\\"\u003e\\n          \u003csection className\u003d\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ch2 className\u003d\\\"text-lg font-bold mb-4 flex items-center\\\"\u003e\\n              \u003cspan className\u003d\\\"bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs mr-2\\\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\\n              Upload Selfie\\n            \u003c/h2\u003e\\n            {!originalImage ? (\\n              \u003cdiv \\n                onClick\u003d{() \u003d\u003e fileInputRef.current?.click()}\\n                className\u003d\\\"border-2 border-dashed border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-pointer hover:border-indigo-400 hover:bg-indigo-50 transition-all group\\\"\\n              \u003e\\n                \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\\\"\u003e\\n                  \u003csvg xmlns\u003d\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" className\u003d\\\"h-6 w-6\\\" fill\u003d\\\"none\\\" viewBox\u003d\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" stroke\u003d\\\"currentColor\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cpath strokeLinecap\u003d\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin\u003d\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth\u003d{2} d\u003d\\\"M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-8l-4-4m0 0L8 8m4-4v12\\\" /\u003e\\n                  \u003c/svg\u003e\\n                \u00